      "Language": "dan",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A case of a 10 cm in diameter and 450 ml large pericardial coelom cyst causing chest pain in a previously healthy 38-year-old man is reported. The cyst was diagnosed by transthoracic echocardiography and computerized tomography. The patient recovered without complications following surgical removal of the cyst."},
